  "Namo · 飞书连接本地 Agent（首版支持 Codex）\n\n用法：namo <命令> [--config 路径]\n  init                 可恢复的交互初始化、飞书引导和用户配对\n  doctor [--live]       分层诊断；--live 会调用模型并使用账号额度\n  agent list           探测本机执行器，标明尚未支持的后端\n  agent profiles       查看已配置的 Agent 注册表\n  agent probe --profile ID [--json]\n                       只读检查安装、协议和登录状态；不调用模型\n  agent use --profile ID\n                       设置新工作流的默认 Agent 配置\n  agent test --live [--profile ID]\n                       真实 Agent 响应测试（会使用账号额度）\n  login [--profile ID] 登录指定的 Namo 独立官方 Agent 环境\n  start                前台接收（Ctrl+C 停止接收，已开工任务继续）\n  status               消息队列和后台服务状态\n  logs                 最近 80 行日志（自动脱敏）\n  service <操作>       install / status / start / stop / restart / upgrade / uninstall\n  ui                   打开仅本机可访问的管理界面（Ctrl+C 关闭）\n  issues               列出待核对异常\n  issue <编号>         查看异常与核对版本\n  resolve <编号> <版本> <动作> <依据> --confirm\n                       received / retry / dismiss / reviewed；不会重跑模型\n  config path          显示当前配置文件位置\n\n--json 可用于 doctor / agent list / agent profiles / agent probe / agent use / status。未指定配置时优先使用\nNAMO_CONFIG、当前目录已有 config.local.json，再使用系统用户目录。\n首版后台服务管理仅支持 macOS；其他平台可使用前台模式。\n初始化不会自动安装 Agent、迁移 OpenClaw 或发布应用。": "Namo · Connect Feishu with your local agent (Codex supported)\n\nUsage: namo <command> [--config path] [--lang system|en|zh-CN]\n  init                 Resumable setup, Feishu configuration and user pairing\n  doctor [--live]       Diagnostics; --live calls the model and uses account quota\n  agent list           Detect local agents and identify unsupported backends\n  agent profiles       Show configured agent profiles\n  agent probe --profile ID [--json]\n                       Read-only install, protocol, and sign-in checks; never calls the model\n  agent use --profile ID\n                       Set the default agent profile for new workstreams\n  agent test --live [--profile ID]\n                       Run a real agent response test (uses account quota)\n  login [--profile ID] Sign in to the selected isolated official agent environment\n  start                Foreground receiver (Ctrl+C stops intake; active tasks continue)\n  status               Message queue and background service status\n  logs                 Last 80 log lines (credentials redacted)\n  service <action>     install / status / start / stop / restart / upgrade / uninstall\n  ui                   Open the local workbench (Ctrl+C closes it)\n  issues               List issues awaiting review\n  issue <id>           Inspect an issue and its review version\n  resolve <id> <version> <action> <notes> --confirm\n                       received / retry / dismiss / reviewed; never reruns the model\n  config path          Show the current configuration path\n\n--json is available for doctor / agent list / agent profiles / agent probe / agent use / status. Configuration precedence:\nNAMO_CONFIG, an existing config.local.json in the current directory, then the user directory.\nBackground service management supports macOS; other platforms can use foreground mode.\nSetup does not install agents, migrate OpenClaw or publish applications.",
